          "path": "_m/t/k/x/6/makran-coastal-highway-wp/makran-coastal-highway-to-heav.jpg",
          "filename": "Makran Coastal Highway to Heaven -.jpg",
          "caption": "Hingol National Park or Hungol National Park  covers an area of 1,650 square kilometres  and is the largest National Park in Pakistan. It was established in 1988.\nWell this place is known as Hingol  located in south east Pakistan region of Balochistan which until recent was home to extreme separatist which made this place unaccessible to normal public due to dangers of being abducted by separatist who appose the government ,the fact that this particular region is home to a lots beautiful places which have not been explored by local or international people which made this region a must go location for explorers and photographers , recently a military operation lead to peace in this region which in return gateways to explore Balochistan The Hidden Paradise pf Pakistan",
          "alt": "Hingol National Park or Hungol National Park  covers an area of 1,650 square kilometres  and is the largest National Park in Pakistan. It was established in 1988.\nWell this place is known as Hingol  located in south east Pakistan region of Balochistan which until recent was home to extreme separatist which made this place unaccessible to normal public due to dangers of being abducted by separatist who appose the government ,the fact that this particular region is home to a lots beautiful places which have not been explored by local or international people which made this region a must go location for explorers and photographers , recently a military operation lead to peace in this region which in return gateways to explore Balochistan The Hidden Paradise pf Pakistan",
